      {
        "_uid": "e1f217f5-aa2b-d392-f1f7-cb13ecb07d7e",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Dr. Zulfiqar Bhutta, Director of the Institute for Global Health and Development, contributed his expertise to a panel discussion during this broadcast, emphasizing the pivotal role of research as a catalyst for transformative change. As the world's attention turns towards COP28 in Dubai, this event served as a gathering point for leaders, diplomats, business executives, NGO representatives, and climate activists, fostering deliberations on the critical actions needed to address the climate crisis comprehensively. Dr. Bhutta's active participation underscored research's indispensable role in shaping sustainable solutions for a brighter future.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "For more details and to view the complete program, you can access the We Don't Have Time Climate Week NYC program via this link: ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Watch the full program here",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_a9Mu2I9DHQ&t=7488s",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": ". Dr. Bhutta's panel discussion can be found at 2:59:42 in the video.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
