    "show_share": true,
    "description": "During the recent We Don't Have Time Climate Week NYC broadcast held on September 21, 2023, an essential dialogue unfolded, addressing critical pre-COP28 topics. The discussion scrutinized the impact of ESG (Environmental, Social, Governance) in propelling genuine climate action versus inadvertently aiding corporate greenwashing. Furthermore, it delved into the prospect of achieving climate-neutral food systems and explored strategies for transcending GDP measurements to combat the climate crisis effectively.",
